{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:51.288239+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Hi @Corendos ,\n\nThank you for creating this issue. To help us investigate, please share the steps you performed.","created_at":"2026-02-23T07:10:15Z","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/38082#issuecomment-3943057926","id":3943057926,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHyx1PM7rBkoG","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/3943057926/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-02-23T07:10:15Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/3943057926","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194224583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penumallas1261","id":194224583,"login":"penumallas1261","node_id":"U_kgDOC5Ohxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @penumallas1261 thanks for the answer, here is a step-by-step process to reproduce the issue:\n* Clone my fork of the repo, `git clone git@github.com:Corendos/xla.git`\n* Checkout the branch `git checkout corendos/warp-specialize-hang`\n* Launch the docker image used to build XLA\n  `docker run -itd --rm --gpus all --name xla -w /xla -v $PWD:/xla us-docker.pkg.dev/ml-oss-artifacts-published/ml-public-container/ml-build:latest bash`\n* Configure the repo `docker exec xla ./configure.py --backend=CUDA`\n* Build and run the test\n  `docker exec xla bazel run --spawn_strategy=sandboxed,standalone --test_output=all //xla/service/gpu/tests:gpu_triton_custom_call_test_h100`\n\nThe test should build and start but never complete.","created_at":"2026-02-23T08:45:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/38082#issuecomment-3943406956","id":3943406956,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHyx1PM7rC51s","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/3943406956/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-02-23T08:45:31Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/3943406956","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1839807?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Corendos","id":1839807,"login":"Corendos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Mzk4MDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Corendos","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I've encountered a hang bug while trying to run a Triton kernel using warp specialization.\n\nOriginally it was using a complex batched matmul kernel but I managed to reduce the hanging kernel to around 20 lines.\n\nHere is the kernel (tried on RTX5090):\n\n```mlir\nmodule {\n  tt.func public @tma_kernel(%arg0: !tt.ptr<f16, 1> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32}, %arg1: !tt.ptr<f16, 1> {tt.divisibility = 16 : i32}) {\n    %c0_i32 = arith.constant 0 : i32\n    %c1_i32 = arith.constant 1 : i32\n    %c2_i32 = arith.constant 2 : i32\n    %c64_i32 = arith.constant 64 : i32\n    %c64_i64 = arith.constant 64 : i64\n    %c1_i64 = arith.constant 1 : i64\n\n    %desc0 = tt.make_tensor_descriptor %arg0, [%c64_i32, %c64_i32], [%c64_i64, %c1_i64] : <f16>, <tensor<64x64xf16>>\n    %desc1 = tt.make_tensor_descriptor %arg1, [%c64_i32, %c64_i32], [%c64_i64, %c1_i64] : <f16>, <tensor<64x64xf16>>\n    scf.for %i = %c0_i32 to %c2_i32 step %c1_i32 : i32 {\n      %8 = arith.muli %c0_i32, %c64_i32 : i32\n      %9 = arith.muli %c0_i32, %c64_i32 : i32\n\n      %10 = tt.descriptor_load %desc0[%8, %9] : !tt.tensordesc<tensor<64x64xf16>> -> tensor<64x64xf16>\n      tt.descriptor_store %desc1[%8, %9], %10 : !tt.tensordesc<tensor<64x64xf16>>, tensor<64x64xf16>\n      scf.yield\n    } {tt.flatten, tt.warp_specialize}\n    tt.return\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThis example is voluntarily weird (useless loop) but it's the only way to trigger the bug I've found.\n\nHere are my observations:\n* If you set the loop upper-bound to 1 instead of 2 (by changing the line `%c2_i32 = arith.constant 2 : i32` to `%c2_i32 = arith.constant 1 : i32`, there is no more hanging\n* If you remove the `tt.warp_specialize` attribute on the loop, no more hanging\n\nNote that this kernel runs fine with the python version of Triton (3.6.0) that's why I'm opening an issue here.\n\nIf you want to reproduce, you can use this branch: https://github.com/Corendos/xla/tree/corendos/warp-specialize-hang\nI added a test to `xla/service/gpu/tests/gpu_triton_custom_call_test.cc`\n\nIf you need any additional information, feel free to ping me !","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082/comments","created_at":"2026-02-20T11:02:44Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/38082","id":3967954162,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":4409976544,"name":"bug","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"008672","default":false,"description":"Awaiting response from openxla-eng","id":4409976552,"name":"stat:awaiting openxla-eng","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm6A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/stat:awaiting%20openxla-eng"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"429786","default":false,"description":"XLA on GPU","id":4432380595,"name":"GPU","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABCDDCsw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/GPU"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/38082/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOHyx1PM7sgizy","number":38082,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/